Original commit body from 0683772:

- Add more patterns to detect Android from build.gradle:
  - `android {` block (present in all Android projects)
  - `com.android.tools.build:gradle` dependency
- Add AndroidManifest.xml detection as definitive indicator
- Add tests for build.gradle and AndroidManifest.xml detection

This fixes detection gaps in repos like tensorflow and android-ndk-samples
that use custom Gradle plugin IDs but still have Android DSL blocks or
AndroidManifest.xml files.
